  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Advisory Services  - Ordnance Survey</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this partnership is to support delivery of the Land Facility&#x2019;s objectives by (a) drawing on OS&#x2019;s technical expertise and consultancy to provide strategic guidance to FCDO and the Programme Steering Committee, and (b) by OS offering its suite of geospatial advisory services to support the delivery of Country Support Projects, managed by the LF Lead Supplier in partner countries. Geospatial Advisory Services shall include general geospatial advice to governments and also a discrete Geospatial Readiness Assessment to help governments identify gaps and priorities to improve geospatial data and systems to underpin land registration and other sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
